  "Maximum cost reserved for outstanding attempts, integer micro-USD as string (never binary floats). Encumbered until reconciliation even after timeout/cancel."
  costReservedMicroUsd: String
  "Authoritative usage when known; null means unknown/unreconciled, NOT zero."
